  Text: 'Whatever she experienced sent her into deep shell-shocked state. and then
    we came along and wiped her mind clean.


    She no longer repeats "there were
    two at 54" now.


    Her pockets are empty, she carries no possessions with
    her whatsoever. Who travels like that?'
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
